    jit_class_array_field_store_write_lost_2026-11-27, 0, "Registered 2026-11-27 by p3sweep2 wave-6 lane as the R2 residual of engine_specs_spec_runner_interpreter_divergence_2026-09-16: on the JIT lane NodeStore3D.set_position's self.nodes[i] = updated write is lost across the call boundary (second render sees the pre-move position); interpreter lane correct. Minimal repro build/p3cache/engspec/render_probe.spl, controls place_probe.spl/place_probe2.spl, evidence build/p3cache/engspec/EVIDENCE.md section R2. Plain class-array stores pass on both engines; trigger is the method-call plus array-field combination. The document remains the authority for diagnosis and acceptance."

